\end{aligned}
$$
Let $\pi x^2=t \Rightarrow 2 \pi x d x=d t$
When $x=\frac{1}{2}, t=\frac{\pi}{4}$ and $x=\frac{1}{4}, t=\frac{\pi}{16}$
$$
\begin{aligned}
